# Matplotlib Plot Examples

A Python project demonstrating the most commonly used plots in Matplotlib with clear examples.

## Features

- Line Plot
- Bar Chart
- Horizontal Bar Chart
- Pie Chart
- Scatter Plot
- Histogram
- Box Plot
- Violin Plot
- Area Plot
- Stem Plot
- Step Plot
- Stack Plot
- Error Bar Plot
- Hexbin Plot
- Polar Plot
- Multiple Line Plot
- Subplots
- Heatmap
- Contour Plot
- Filled Contour Plot
- 3D Line Plot
- 3D Scatter Plot
- 3D Surface Plot

## Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/matplotlib-plot-examples.git
cd matplotlib-plot-examples
pip install matplotlib numpy
```

## Usage

Run any example:

```bash
python line_plot.py
```

## Requirements

- Python 3.9+
- Matplotlib
- NumPy

Install dependencies:

```bash
pip install matplotlib numpy
```

