## Supported Plot Types

| Plot Type | Function |
|-----------|----------|
| Line Plot | `plt.plot()` |
| Bar Chart | `plt.bar()` |
| Horizontal Bar | `plt.barh()` |
| Pie Chart | `plt.pie()` |
| Scatter Plot | `plt.scatter()` |
| Histogram | `plt.hist()` |
| Box Plot | `plt.boxplot()` |
| Violin Plot | `plt.violinplot()` |
| Area Plot | `plt.fill_between()` |
| Step Plot | `plt.step()` |
| Stem Plot | `plt.stem()` |
| Stack Plot | `plt.stackplot()` |
| Error Bar | `plt.errorbar()` |
| Hexbin Plot | `plt.hexbin()` |
| Polar Plot | `plt.polar()` |
| Heatmap | `plt.imshow()` |
| Contour Plot | `plt.contour()` |
| Filled Contour | `plt.contourf()` |
| 3D Line | `ax.plot3D()` |
| 3D Scatter | `ax.scatter3D()` |
| 3D Surface | `ax.plot_surface()` |

## Example

```python
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt

x = [1,2,3,4,5]
y = [2,4,6,8,10]

plt.plot(x, y, marker="o")
plt.title("Simple Line Plot")
plt.xlabel("X-axis")
plt.ylabel("Y-axis")
plt.grid(True)
plt.show()

```

